    "root_cause_investigation": "During the initial drafting of Reference Corpus v1.0.2, an interim markdown report template was drafted using an approximate preliminary heuristic allocation table (which reported 5, 4, 6, 5, 7, 7, 5, 6). However, when the build script was executed using exact spherical HEALPix polygon distance calculations, the deterministic spatial assignment across HEALPix pixels yielded the exact class counts: (6, 3, 7, 4, 7, 6, 6, 6; Total=45). This exact partition was committed in reference_corpus_v1_manifest.json at git commit 40e3e60. The JSON manifest committed at 40e3e60, 19aa786, 8fbed7e, and HEAD has always contained the exact same 45 objects with class distribution (6, 3, 7, 4, 7, 6, 6, 6). Exactly 0 objects have ever shifted partition or class label between commit 40e3e60 and HEAD.",
